    "sections": {
        "description": "GamerNews is a sleek, dark-mode WordPress theme built for gaming blogs, eSports magazines, and tech news publishers. Featuring bold purple and pink accents, customizable light mode, and seamless integration with Elementor, Beaver Builder, Brizy, Visual Composer, Divi, and SiteOrigin, it offers powerful visual impact and design flexibility. GamerNews is lightweight, fully responsive, SEO-friendly, and compatible with WooCommerce, Jetpack, Contact Form 7, and Yoast SEO. With 1-click demo import, multilingual and RTL support, and pre-designed layouts, it’s perfect for gamers, streamers, and content creators looking to launch fast and stand out. Explore demos and documentation at https://afthemes.com/products/gamernews/"
    },
